WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.001
Where the power goes. An authored room beside recorded ESIF facility power.

2
00:00:08.517 --> 00:00:13.023
Constructed racks, working lights and water services. No per-rack readings are inferred.

3
00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:19.149
Approach the water loop. Its meter is a whole-facility category.

4
00:00:19.176 --> 00:00:22.676
The geometry is authored. The source clock and raw records stay separately inspectable.

5
00:00:22.698 --> 00:00:28.711
Two recorded hours: period PUE falls while estimated mean facility power rises by 10.077%.

6
00:00:28.747 --> 00:00:34.261
A separate supply scenario: grid cap, battery reserve, conversion loss and unmet energy.
